WEBVTT

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:18.620
Welcome, sir.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:25.630
I've called three days ago to book a
reservation. The name is Duke Togo.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:28.750
Yes, I see we have reserved a room for you.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.630
We've prepared one for you that's on the top floor and receives a lot of sunlight.

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:35.180
Ah, pardon me...

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.140
We've neglected to ask what your schedule is.

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:39.890
I'm not on a schedule.

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:44.640
If you need to know, I plan to stay one or two weeks.

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:49.150
I see, you're here for recreation. How splendid!

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:52.440
Although this town is small, it is still a lovely place.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:56.160
Still, it's ironic how we live in a famous health resort town yet never get a chance to rest.

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:47.920
I walk unsteadily on paths to nowhere

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:52.050
wondering what I should do right now.

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:58.510
I play the song you like on the car stereo

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:03.060
with the volume up and my feelings crystallized

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:08.690
driving on streets with no crossroads or signals

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:14.110
with a speed that will catch up with you.

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:18.570
So faraway - let's run!

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:24.870
And let's not bother with the breaks - full throttle.

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:29.170
Oh someday - one of these days

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:34.250
You'll be at my place where nobody can find you.

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:40.340
Whenever you suffer a breakdown one can't see

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:45.930
depend on me for your repairs.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:50.310
So faraway - let's run!

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:56.530
We'll reset and start again - even at our limit.

00:02:56.730 --> 00:03:00.820
Oh someday - one of these days

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:06.870
If I'm with you we'll find our dream.

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:24.890
The Unceasing Night

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:28.640
Congratulations, Monsieur Bardot.

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:30.640
Congratulations, Mayor Bardot.

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:33.810
Why thank you. Thank you all.

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:38.820
Congratulations, Mayor.

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:39.900
Congratulations.

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:53.620
Sir, you have my sincerest apologies for this commotion.

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:59.460
Mayor Bardot is holding his three-
year wedding anniversary tonight.

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:05.510
It will continue for some time, so if you'd prefer we can provide you with some beverages in your room...

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:08.510
No, I'll stay.

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:10.310
I will have a gimlet.

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:19.860
Despite my suggestions that he hold the
party at his residence, he was quite insistent.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:23.240
So we let him make use of our little hotel bar.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:28.410
Here sir.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:30.790
It's on the house.

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:34.000
If you need anything, please let us know.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:35.460
Thank you.

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:56.770
Whoa!

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:58.820
Are you all right?

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:01.860
Forgive me. Thank you very much.

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:05.740
What's wrong, Madame? You look pale!

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:07.490
Oh, uh...

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.330
Is something wrong, Danielle?

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:12.540
Oh, I just wasn't feeling too good.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:16.330
I see. You must be getting tired.

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.500
Say, who is that woman?

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:22.090
Oh, that's Madame Bardot.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.710
She probably isn't feeling well.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:28.090
Everyone, I am truly sorry.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:31.220
May you excuse us for the moment, my wife has taken ill.

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:34.140
Please continue with your festivities.

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:52.580
What?

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.330
Are you sure about this?

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:57.750
Yes. I am positive.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:00.840
The thing we've most feared has come true!

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:03.340
So that man...

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:09.640
Honey, what are we going to do?

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:15.470
I'll take care of everything.

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:18.600
"T-Take care of"? Honey, what are you-

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:21.690
Listen, you should just shut up and leave everything to me!

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:35.240
Ah, is that true?

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.420
Yes, please!

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:45.090
Isn't... Isn't there any other way?

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:50.180
No, this is our best option.

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:52.760
Our best!

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:55.010
Now look...

00:06:55.560 --> 00:07:00.690
I need to get back to the party before our citizens think something's going on.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:03.810
So I'm heading back to the hotel.

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:07.360
You'll be staying home.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:08.530
Honey...

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:28.550
Oh, you've returned!

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:31.840
Oh, yes! Forgive me for worrying you all.

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:35.600
Is your wife feeling all right?

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:40.270
Oh, she's quite all right. She's just feeling a little tired.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:58.580
What's wrong, Monsieur Bardot?

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:03.540
Are you feeling well? You're look a bit pale.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:06.250
Oh, it's nothing.

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:09.670
I'm just a little worried about my wife whom I left home.

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:12.380
That is something to worry about.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:28.320
Darling, welcome home.

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:34.610
What's wrong? You're scaring me.

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:36.660
Honey...

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:38.780
Danielle!

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:43.500
Danielle! Danielle!

00:08:44.170 --> 00:08:46.080
Honey... sweetheart...

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:49.590
That guy... that guy!

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:56.050
There! Did he do this to you?

00:08:57.260 --> 00:08:58.010
Stop...

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:00.510
Not so...

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:11.820
You bastard...

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:14.570
You bastard! You son of a bitch!

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:19.950
<i>I can't...</i>

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:24.040
<i>I just can't put that night behind me...</i>

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:39.180
You got it. Leave everything to us.

00:09:39.180 --> 00:09:42.470
We're pros at this sort of thing, so you know we'll accept.

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:47.940
So, you're sure this isn't going to come back to haunt us, right?

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:51.690
Hmph. In this line of work, trust is job one.

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:55.240
I mean you wouldn't come to us if we can't be counted on.

00:09:55.240 --> 00:10:00.280
Whatever happens, nothing will blow back on you, Monsieur Bardot.

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:01.870
Good. Very well...

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:06.750
Here's your advance as promised. Now make it happen.

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:25.390
Hmm?

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.690
Are you going out, Monsieur Togo?

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:37.860
Hmm?

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:01.340
Good evening.

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:21.070
Our apologies for making you come this late.

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:22.620
We'll be arriving soon.

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:38.800
Are you coming out?

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:50.640
Are you the one who needed me?

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:52.100
Oh?

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:58.860
I guess unlike some amateurs, us professionals aren't supposed to notice when a gun is being pointed at them.

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.900
Will you state your business?

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:08.580
The fact of the matter is that someone
has a real problem with you being here.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:13.670
Your ass needs to be out of town this very minute and don't even think about coming back!

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:16.130
Who has a problem?

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:19.760
Who gives a rat's ass? Now get the fuck outta town!

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:22.260
If I refuse?

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:25.260
Then we're done making threats.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:29.270
Fine, I'll just beat some sense into you.

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:33.520
I'll make sure you know what a punch from a real professional feels like.

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:49.080
Damn you!

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:53.910
Godammit!

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:13.060
Now about the one that hired you...

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:43.800
I believe you recognize me.

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:46.010
So there's no need to be reserved.

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:52.390
And there's also no need for introductions
seeing as how I've brought along a guest.

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:53.520
Uh, right...

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:57.020
But I don't recall ever dealing with you.

00:13:57.020 --> 00:14:00.520
So why did you want me out of
town even if it meant killing me?

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:03.280
Wh... What did you say?

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:08.070
You must have come to this town just to see us.

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:10.780
So why are you still playing dumb even up to now?

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:14.040
What are you talking about?

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:18.080
So... That means...

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:21.500
You... You don't remember my wife at all?

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:35.680
<i>Hey, lover boy!</i>

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:39.310
<i>Are you down for a good time? It'll only cost you a couple...</i>

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:42.310
<i>Shit! What the... broke-ass prick!</i>

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:44.820
<i>Hey, Mister...</i>

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:48.820
<i>If you want yourself real women, just follow me.</i>

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:53.830
<i>However, it might cost you a pretty penny.</i>

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:30.030
It appears you do remember my wife's past.

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:31.490
Yes.

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:36.580
Last month, we received an unexpected call from a man claiming to be a former john.

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:41.830
Seeing as I'm the mayor, he used my wife's former life to blackmail us.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:44.460
So that really wasn't you?

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:48.960
No.

00:15:51.010 --> 00:15:51.970
Oh...

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:55.720
Is that so?

00:15:56.850 --> 00:16:00.980
So which one of you hired those men?

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:04.310
It's me. I take full responsibility.

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:07.110
My wife was against it from the start.

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:12.400
Isn't this going too far just to protect your status and reputation?

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:14.700
I... I couldn't let it go.

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:19.040
He treated my wife as a common prostitute.

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:21.500
I just couldn't let it go!

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:27.630
I'll ask once more... you didn't plan this?

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:29.250
No!

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:32.220
My wife is completely innocent!

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:34.640
It's me! I did everything!

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:37.050
I take full responsibility!

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:17.010
<i>Who is it?</i>

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:18.800
<i>You even know what time it is?</i>

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:21.430
<i>Danielle?</i>

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:22.930
<i>What's with you?</i>

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:25.850
<i>Why the fuck did you run out on your john?</i>

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:27.900
<i>We need to talk.</i>

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:32.530
<i>Save it for tomorrow, babe. You're still on the clock.</i>

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:36.150
<i>Now get the fuck back to your john.</i>

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:38.030
<i>He's already sound asleep.</i>

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:40.410
<i>Hey... Hey! Listen to me!</i>

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:44.120
<i>Yeah, I hear you sweetie...</i>

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:48.080
<i>That john was so bad in bed you came here for some sexual healing, right?</i>

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:50.670
<i>Please, listen to me.</i>

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:54.090
<i>It's something I need to tell you tonight.</i>

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:54.970
<i>Huh?</i>

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:57.680
<i>I ain't accepting any resignations, sugar.</i>

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.720
<i>But... But I...</i>

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:00.970
<i>Shaddap!</i>

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:06.810
<i>You're my woman, so you just need to do what I fucking say!</i>

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:09.150
<i>Unless you're looking to get smacked around!</i>

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:15.490
<i>I've had it with this life!</i>

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:16.860
<i>What're you...?</i>

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:21.240
<i>I will get out of this life!</i>

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:23.870
<i>W-Wait, Danielle, chill...</i>

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:25.080
<i>Let's talk it over...</i>

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:41.640
<i>Just to let you know...</i>

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:45.770
<i>There's no use using me as an alibi.</i>

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.600
<i>For this does not concern me.</i>

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.310
<i>Yes...</i>

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:58.070
<i>No one would think that a woman put a silencer on a gun to shoot someone.</i>

00:19:00.110 --> 00:19:02.660
<i>Anyways, don't get me involved.</i>

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:05.580
<i>If you value your life.</i>

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.330
Just to let you know...

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:14.460
We have nothing to do with each other.

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:16.210
So don't get me involved.

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:22.590
So that means you'll forget the whole thing?

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:24.470
You'll forgive us?

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:26.720
Don't ever bother me again.

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:29.230
And take care of your accomplices.

00:19:30.600 --> 00:19:33.020
Uh, please wait.

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:36.230
It might not be much, but it's...

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:38.490
I told you not to bother me.

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:48.120
I... I must...

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:49.370
What's wrong, Danielle?

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:52.120
Actually... I...

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:55.750
Hey, Danielle!

00:19:57.210 --> 00:19:58.630
Wait... Wait!

00:19:58.630 --> 00:19:59.260
Danielle!

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:09.810
Come inside, Madame Bardot.

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:11.560
You...

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:14.770
Please, I beg you! Stop this!

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:19.570
Danielle! Danielle!

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:25.820
Huh? So you're putting the kibosh on the contract?

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:26.950
That's right!

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:30.080
I don't wish to kill that man now!

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:32.580
Now walk away! I beg you!

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:34.250
Please?

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:37.250
I'll still pay you the money!

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:40.380
I can't do that, Madame.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:42.880
Huh? Why's that?

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:44.630
I said I'll pay you!

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:47.640
This isn't just some job to me anymore.

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:49.970
That guy, you see...

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:54.100
He's known around the world as a man for hire who's at the very top of his league.

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:58.020
Who goes by that pretentious name, Golgo 13.

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:04.700
Once I learned I was going up against
him, it was no longer business as usual.

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:10.080
Yes, not business. Now I want to see if I can
punch a hole through his head with hot lead!

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:19.500
Don't!

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:23.220
Out of the way!

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:30.220
<i>Not... that night again...</i>

00:22:06.970 --> 00:22:08.510
In the end...

00:22:08.510 --> 00:22:12.010
I... was never able...

00:22:12.010 --> 00:22:14.220
...to free myself from that night.

00:22:43.800 --> 00:22:47.090
I  was worried with no one to talk to.

00:22:47.090 --> 00:22:50.140
I was brooding and standing still

00:22:50.140 --> 00:22:52.300
without moving a muscle.

00:22:52.970 --> 00:22:55.470
I wonder when that was?

00:22:55.970 --> 00:22:57.180
I'm sure

00:22:57.180 --> 00:23:00.350
you agonized over how

00:23:00.350 --> 00:23:05.610
people will hurt themselves and other people

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:08.860
and fail to realize it.

00:23:09.240 --> 00:23:09.990
When

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:13.410
the same days keep repeating themselves

00:23:13.410 --> 00:23:15.660
you never change.

00:23:16.370 --> 00:23:17.910
Since you're here for me

00:23:17.910 --> 00:23:22.210
I will accept the way that I am.

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:26.460
I will never leave you alone

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:29.800
I will softly touch your trembling heart.

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:36.680
I realized that I'm not the only one who's alone.

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:39.850
We're enveloped in the gentle sun beams.

00:23:39.850 --> 00:23:43.190
The long winter is finally over.

00:23:43.190 --> 00:23:49.820
The parts of us that were lonely will surely get stronger.

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:05.090
A kid thought to be Golgo's son.

00:24:05.630 --> 00:24:11.510
And a Mafia man targeted by Golgo who plans to use that kid to his advantage.

00:24:12.760 --> 00:24:17.390
So what was the anticipated reaction from a man who's above everything?

00:24:17.810 --> 00:24:23.020
Next time on Golgo 13: (Kuroi Hitomi) Ebony Eyes.

00:24:18.060 --> 00:24:24.400
(Kuroi Hitomi) Ebony Eyes

00:24:23.600 --> 00:24:27.520
Don't stand behind him, if you value your life.
